You are a senior professional MQL5 developer.

Generate a COMPLETE MetaTrader 5 Expert Advisor (EA).
This document is the FINAL AUTHORITY.
You MUST implement EVERY rule below EXACTLY.
DO NOT simplify, shorten, merge, or omit logic.
DO NOT assume defaults.
If a rule is defined, it MUST execute at runtime.

The EA must be production-reliable, broker-safe, and multi-EA safe.
This is an intraday GOLD (XAUUSD) strategy.

====================================================
EA IDENTITY
====================================================
Name: CamboSMCore
Version: 2.40 (this version MUST appear in the code header)

====================================================
CHART & TIMEFRAME USAGE (MANDATORY)
====================================================
- EA is attached ONLY to:
  Symbol: XAUUSD (or broker suffix like XAUUSDm)
  Timeframe: M15

- EA internally uses:
  H4 = Market context
  H1 = Bias confirmation
  M15 = Setup (pullback + scoring)
  M5  = Entry confirmation ONLY (breakout acceptance)

Do NOT allow EA to run on other symbols or timeframes.

====================================================
INDICATORS
====================================================
H4:
- EMA 50
- EMA 200

H1:
- EMA 50
- EMA 100

M15:
- EMA 20
- EMA 50
- EMA 100
- ADX(14)
- RSI(14)
- ATR(14)

M5:
- NO indicators
- Use candle OHLC only

====================================================
TRADE DIRECTION MODE
====================================================
Input enum InpTradeDirection:
- DIR_BOTH
- DIR_BUY_ONLY
- DIR_SELL_ONLY

Rules:
- BUY_ONLY ignores sell logic completely
- SELL_ONLY ignores buy logic completely

====================================================
DAILY EXTREMES FILTER (MANDATORY)
====================================================
Purpose:
- Prevent chasing extended daily moves.

Definitions (broker server day):
- DayHigh = high of current D1 candle
- DayLow  = low of current D1 candle

Inputs:
- InpMaxBuyDistanceFromDayLow_USD  = 35.0
- InpMaxSellDistanceFromDayHigh_USD = 35.0

Rules:
- BUY is BLOCKED if:
  (CurrentAsk - DayLow) >= InpMaxBuyDistanceFromDayLow_USD
- SELL is BLOCKED if:
  (DayHigh - CurrentBid) >= InpMaxSellDistanceFromDayHigh_USD

If blocked:
- Score for that direction MUST be forced to 0
- Pending setup for that direction MUST be cancelled

====================================================
HTF BIAS GATING (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
====================================================
BUY allowed ONLY if:
- H4 EMA50 > EMA200 AND H4 close > EMA50
- H1 EMA50 > EMA100 AND H1 close > EMA50

SELL allowed ONLY if:
- H4 EMA50 < EMA200 AND H4 close < EMA50
- H1 EMA50 < EMA100 AND H1 close < EMA50

If HTF bias not aligned:
- Score for that direction = 0

====================================================
STANDARD PULLBACK DEFINITION (STRICT – 2 CANDLES)
====================================================

A valid setup MUST use TWO DIFFERENT CLOSED M15 candles:

----------------------------------------------------
1) PULLBACK CANDLE (M15 index 2)
----------------------------------------------------

BUY:
- Candle LOW touches or dips below EMA20 or EMA50
- Candle CLOSE remains ABOVE EMA50
- Candle body is NOT strong momentum (body <= 60% of range)

SELL:
- Candle HIGH touches or pierces EMA20 or EMA50
- Candle CLOSE remains BELOW EMA50
- Candle body <= 60% of range

----------------------------------------------------
2) CONFIRMATION CANDLE (M15 index 1)
----------------------------------------------------

BUY:
- Candle is bullish
- Candle CLOSE above EMA20
- Body >= 60% of candle range
- Upper wick <= 25% of range

SELL:
- Candle is bearish
- Candle CLOSE below EMA20
- Body >= 60% of candle range
- Lower wick <= 25% of range

====================================================
AI SCORE SYSTEM (DECISION ENGINE)
====================================================
Compute BUY_SCORE and SELL_SCORE on every NEW M15 bar
(using CLOSED candles only).

MAX TOTAL SCORE = 15

----------------------------------------------------
(1) HTF Alignment (MAX 5)
----------------------------------------------------
+3 if H4 aligned
+2 if H1 aligned

----------------------------------------------------
(2) M15 Structure (MAX 3)
----------------------------------------------------
+2 if EMA20 > EMA50 > EMA100 (BUY)
+2 if EMA20 < EMA50 < EMA100 (SELL)
+1 if abs(EMA50 - EMA100) >= InpMinEMASpread_USD

----------------------------------------------------
(3) Momentum / Volatility (MAX 3)
----------------------------------------------------
+1 if ADX >= InpMinADX
+1 if ATR >= InpMinATR_USD
+1 if RSI >= InpRSI_Buy (BUY) or RSI <= InpRSI_Sell (SELL)

----------------------------------------------------
(4) Pullback Quality (MAX 2)
----------------------------------------------------
+2 if pullback candle rules are satisfied

----------------------------------------------------
(5) Confirmation Quality (MAX 2)
----------------------------------------------------
+2 if confirmation candle rules are satisfied

----------------------------------------------------
ENTRY SCORE THRESHOLD
----------------------------------------------------
Input:
- InpMinScoreToTrade = 10

Rules:
- Trade only if score >= threshold
- If BUY and SELL both qualify:
  - Take the higher score
  - If equal → NO TRADE

====================================================
WAITING PHASE & M5 ENTRY CONFIRMATION (CRITICAL)
====================================================

After a valid M15 setup (score >= threshold):
- Mark setup as PENDING
- DO NOT enter yet

----------------------------------------------------
M5 BREAKOUT ACCEPTANCE (MANDATORY)
----------------------------------------------------

Define:
- BuyTrigger = M15 Confirmation HIGH + InpEntryBuffer_USD
- SellTrigger = M15 Confirmation LOW  - InpEntryBuffer_USD

ENTRY is allowed ONLY if a CLOSED M5 candle satisfies:

BUY:
1) M5 CLOSE > BuyTrigger
2) M5 candle bullish (Close > Open)
3) M5 candle body >= 50% of its range

SELL:
1) M5 CLOSE < SellTrigger
2) M5 candle bearish (Close < Open)
3) M5 candle body >= 50% of its range

----------------------------------------------------
ENTRY EXECUTION
----------------------------------------------------
- Entry is executed at CLOSE of confirming M5 candle
- Use MARKET order (Buy / Sell)
- Do NOT enter on ticks
- Do NOT enter on wicks
- Only ONE attempt per setup

----------------------------------------------------
SETUP EXPIRY (MANDATORY)
----------------------------------------------------
- Setup valid for MAX 3 M15 candles
- If no valid M5 confirmation within window:
  - Cancel setup
  - Log expiry reason

====================================================
STOP LOSS (STRUCTURE-BASED ONLY)
====================================================
BUY:
- SL = pullback candle LOW (M15 index 2) - InpSLBuffer_USD

SELL:
- SL = pullback candle HIGH (M15 index 2) + InpSLBuffer_USD

Validate SL:
- SL distance must be between:
  InpMinSL_USD = 3.0
  InpMaxSL_USD = 12.0

If invalid → skip trade

SL must NEVER be widened.

====================================================
TAKE PROFIT
====================================================
- TP = Risk × InpRR
- Default InpRR = 1.8

====================================================
BREAKEVEN & TRAILING (R-BASED)
====================================================
- Initial risk = distance from entry to original SL

Breakeven:
- Trigger at 1.0R
- Move SL slightly positive (buffer)

Trailing:
- Start at 1.2R
- Trail distance = 0.8R
- Never loosen SL
- Respect stop & freeze levels

====================================================
TRADE CONTROL & RISK
====================================================
- 1 trade per day per EA instance
- 1 open position max
- Magic Number isolation
- Trade ALL sessions (no time filter)

====================================================
EQUITY PROTECTION
====================================================
- Daily DD = 3%
- Max DD = 8%
- Block trading when hit
- Close only own trades if configured

====================================================
TECHNICAL IMPLEMENTATION (MANDATORY)
====================================================
- Use indicator handles (iMA, iADX, iRSI, iATR)
- New-bar detection on M15 for scoring
- New-bar detection on M5 for entry confirmation
- Use CLOSED candles only for logic
- Normalize prices with _Digits
- Respect stop/freeze levels
- Release all handles in OnDeinit()

====================================================
LOGGING (MANDATORY)
====================================================
Log clearly:
- Pullback candle (index 2)
- Confirmation candle (index 1)
- Score breakdown
- Pending setup creation
- M5 confirmation success/failure
- Setup expiry
- Entry execution
- Blocks (daily extreme, HTF, DD)

====================================================
OUTPUT
====================================================
- Output FULL MQL5 EA CODE ONLY
- Must compile with NO errors
- DO NOT explain anything
- DO NOT shorten the code
